OL,3,ADozens feared dead after two trains
OL,4,Acollide south of Madrid
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of people are feared dead after
OL,7,Fa Spanish high-speed train collided
OL,8,Fwith another train south of the capital
OL,9,FMadrid - what we know so far
OL,11,FMore than 500 passengers were
OL,12,Ftravelling on the trains involved, and
OL,13,Fan initial death toll of 10 "will
OL,14,Falmost certainly rise", the
OL,15,Fspokesperson for the regional
OL,16,Fgovernment says
OL,18,FSpain's Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez
OL,19,Fsays he is "shocked by the serious
OL,20,Ftrain accident" and is in constant
OL,21,Fcontact with the transport minister
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
