OL,3,ADozens feared dead after two trains
OL,4,Acollide south of Madrid
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail operator Adif says the incident
OL,7,Foccurred between a Renfe train and
OL,8,Fanother of the Iryo company, which
OL,9,Fcovers the Madrid to Seville route
